1. Investigate DigiCert Automation Capabilities (Highest Priority)

Purpose
Determine how much of the DigiCert lifecycle can be automated.

Research Areas

CertCentral API
Certificate request API
Certificate download API
Domain validation API
Pre-validation process
Validation reuse process
ACME support
Trust Lifecycle Manager (TLM)
Billing/approval workflow limitations

Deliverable
Documented capabilities, limitations, and recommended approach.

2. Investigate NSX-ALB Certificate Automation

Purpose
Determine whether certificate deployment can be automated.

Research Areas

Certificate import API
Certificate replacement API
Virtual Service binding API
SSL profile updates
Validation/testing methods

Deliverable
Proof that certificates can be uploaded and bound through API.

3. Investigate Fastly Certificate Automation

Purpose
Determine whether Fastly updates can be automated.

Research Areas

Certificate upload API
Private key upload API
Service activation process
Validation requirements

Deliverable
Documented Fastly automation workflow.

4. Investigate Certificate Expiration Monitoring & Alerting

This came directly from Dennis.

Purpose
Determine how automation should be triggered.

Research Areas

Existing certificate inventory
Expiration monitoring
Teams alerts
TeamCity scheduled jobs
Pre-validation trigger timing

Deliverable
Recommended alerting and trigger architecture.

5. Document Recommended SSL Automation Architecture

This should be the final ticket after the above investigations.

